"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"379282","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"94299","synopsis":"南笙带着白钰袖一行人去往何穗所指的密林深处，入口遇极为熟悉的迷阵，照记忆闯入后未见白沐贞却找到了一个同为白发的怪人，在几人聊天过程中发现白发之人的身份并不简单……","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gKzmdswtGgjBT2PmlYLh0HLT3mb.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18159","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"141868","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"55692","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"105075","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"379282","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"94300","synopsis":"被白月迷阵困住的幽冥二绝硬闯迷阵，白月冲上前去以一敌二。器绝和拳绝使出的绝技使白月体会到了生死间的感悟并且领悟了以前兄长同她说的什么叫作武功的纯粹。正在打得不可开交时，一声巨响，只见后头小屋尽毁，一个人影从烟雾中走出……","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wZ5Z9cN3wUy2gT7RTfuX9Nrsv3F.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18159","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"141868","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"55692","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"105075","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"379282","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"94301","synopsis":"白月发现白钰袖无相功失控过，意欲带着白钰袖前往密林深处疗伤练功并保护她周全，而其余的人因得到柳如烟消息而前往迦叶寺寻找沉飞燕。在分别之前，几人准备了一场晚宴，作最后的告别。在晚宴中，南笙继续讲着起初在船上没讲完的故事……","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3TwWYJHADkNVxkRwV6ff6hktQj8.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18159","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"141868","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"55692","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"105075","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"379282","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"94302","synopsis":"白钰袖跟着白月进往密林深处开始为期一年的疗伤练功。另一边去往迦叶寺的风铃儿一行人，在马车上互相交谈着。风铃儿为大家讲述以前跟师父沉飞燕一起经历的侠盗之事，致使崔玉和墨云听得目瞪口呆，崇拜不已……","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hQLXxu6ILptHx0S0r6midoNyyLc.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18159","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"141868","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"55692","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"105075","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"379282","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"94303","synopsis":"满怀期待满心激动的风铃儿到达迦叶寺，见到了沉飞燕，只是事情并不像她想的那般发展。长老慈心告诉了风铃儿一些真相和事由。另一边，主上东方曜与一个黑影在暗中交谈，意欲从沉飞燕手里抢东西，并一举毁掉迦叶寺……","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oIL3NiG7LmvvkQSVn9fNT1GXXEM.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18159","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"141868","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"55692","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"105075","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"379282","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"94304","synopsis":"幽冥毒绝奉命解决柳如烟，陆幽听闻后随同前往。陆幽道出爱恨情仇，还有与柳如烟沉飞燕纠缠近十年的过往，回忆以前在天涯海阁时的点点滴滴……而一边风铃儿在听了慈心长老的话后，暗自做下决定，不惜一切代价，也定要救师父沉飞燕...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/g5mc80AfcAMPEieVdoLuShw8NQd.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18159","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"141868","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"55692","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"105075","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"379282","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"94305","synopsis":"不出迦叶寺慈心长老和玄空所料，果然即要遭遇变故。青龙会首座邱也以缉拿沉飞燕为由，率众攻入迦叶寺。就在迦叶寺陷入危机时，宗师境第一人玄空出来以一敌三，杀伐果断。见事态不对，神秘人从天而降，将玄空击败，引出了殿后的慈心长老....","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cUwexwG095r4NVNSQSIYG68PneX.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18159","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"141868","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"55692","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"105075","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"379282","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"94306","synopsis":"在白钰袖和风铃儿分别的这一年间，白月一边跟白钰袖讲述着她娘亲的事情，一边帮助白钰袖疗伤练功，教她如何控制心魔。在这一年间，白钰袖时常会想起风铃儿，回忆她们离开南山小筑后的那一段往事……一年的时间转瞬即逝，她们约定的时间快到了，白钰袖已然做好了准备，而此时江湖上传出了武林盛典的风声.....","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kn4nuh4ungYJluEjIpDa1UfpuNq.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 11","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18159","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"141868","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"mal","id":"55692","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"105075","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"379282","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[11]}],"link":"94307","synopsis":"江湖立下规矩，禁止任何白发魔教之人参与盛典，但凡进入，全部拿下。武林盛典召开在即，白钰袖为查明风铃儿加入天下一成为种子选手的真相，决定乔装混入比武会场……另一边，剑疯子查红阳血精和天下一真相，终于有了眉目，但一切都太令人震惊了……","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/NsrvEe8TTgvNawSUvjLd92xfOA.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 12","episodeNumber":12,"sourceEpisodeNumber":12,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18159","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"141868","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"mal","id":"55692","